{"schema_version":1,"status":"partial","epoch":"zhcn-67f8551f7780","task_id":"batch-01398-s02","batch":1398,"shard":2,"source_commit":"67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835","source_queue_git_commit":"ba3815ed06a2a9bb3fddb38a6e1ea7ca64506da2","shard_start":40,"shard_end_exclusive":60,"translated_count":5,"entries":[{"entry_index":40,"uid":"zhcn:470ac855fbe8be3dc0a95b83","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"庆祝达成目标～\r\n嘿呀──！嘿呀──！","source_fingerprint":"ff341fdf222f85fd1240f4948842636461f946f3cdd67b5cbc8ded38ad2dcf59","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1068","10017"],"target_text":"Ăn mừng hoàn thành mục tiêu nào～\r\nHây da──! Hây da──!","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":41,"uid":"zhcn:efbba1b5f55c11dfb8f94a33","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"活动就快到了……！\r\n真是期待呢……\r\n干脆现在先来事先庆祝！？","source_fingerprint":"2a54fb320e0c13c8a0f146c63abcd5ca181bf9af7a27934ecc30f3cf7a745e8c","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1068","10018"],"target_text":"Sự kiện sắp đến rồi……!\r\nMong chờ thật đấy……\r\nHay là mình ăn mừng trước ngay bây giờ luôn nhỉ!?","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":42,"uid":"zhcn:6c0321dc344cbc9482300a52","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"祭典不能光用看的！得实际参加！\r\n来吧来吧，我们走！\r\n由我来带领你！","source_fingerprint":"5384ffa9735cd4ea00c6c9d37847713daad6d946890e64b3101c10b9d6e6ee51","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1068","10019"],"target_text":"Lễ hội đâu thể chỉ đứng nhìn! Phải tham gia chứ!\r\nNào nào, đi thôi!\r\nĐể tôi dẫn đường cho bạn!","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":43,"uid":"zhcn:bb2f43f7c1678e8720f6e2bf","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"可恶～真不甘心！","source_fingerprint":"8ede380eb14a3cb28508773e94e3bf74bf00b630c6773551666a90eebef5fa6a","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1068","1002"],"target_text":"Ôi～ tiếc quá đi!","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":44,"uid":"zhcn:b78925250a41378bc912151f","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"赛马娘名鉴的等级\r\n好像提升了！\r\n要去确认看看吗？","source_fingerprint":"d5f40dc1bb185389b5224df78f91a80a75f08affddf18c2782f446a384509fd3","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1068","10021"],"target_text":"Có vẻ Level của Archive\r\nđã tăng rồi!\r\nMình đi kiểm tra nhé?","reviewed":true}]}